---
import Page from '../../layouts/Page.astro';
import { site } from '../../data/site';
---

<Page
  route="privacy"
  title="Privacy policy"
  heading="Privacy policy"
  description="How the Neura Mobilis website handles your data: no cookies, no analytics, and only the e-mails you choose to send us."
  lead="This website sets no cookies, does not track your browsing and has no forms. The only data we receive is what you send us by e-mail."
>
  <h2>Data controller</h2>
  <p>{site.publisher}, for the Neura Mobilis project. Contact: <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a></p>

  <h2>E-mails you send us</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>What we receive</strong>: your e-mail address and the content of your message.</li>
    <li><strong>Why</strong>: to answer you and, if you wish, organise your participation in the Mobilis test.</li>
    <li><strong>Legal basis</strong>: your request, expressed by writing to us.</li>
    <li><strong>How long</strong>: until the end of the test, then deleted, unless you ask us to keep you informed.</li>
    <li><strong>Who can see it</strong>: only the Neura Mobilis team. We do not sell or share your data.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    We do not ask for any information about your health. If you send us some, we do not keep it beyond
    what is needed to answer you.
  </p>

  <h2>Website hosting</h2>
  <p>
    The website is hosted by {site.host.name}. To serve pages and protect the site, the host processes
    technical data such as your IP address. This data may be processed outside the European Union, within
    the framework provided by the GDPR.
  </p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    You can access your data, have it corrected or deleted, object to its processing or ask for its
    restriction and portability by writing to <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>. You can
    also lodge a complaint with the French data protection authority, the CNIL
    (<a href="https://www.cnil.fr">cnil.fr</a>), or the authority of your country.
  </p>

  <h2>The Mobilis app</h2>
  <p>This policy covers the website. The Mobilis app will have its own privacy policy.</p>
</Page>
